laurel 2951: boot state for a phone with no picture and no SSH: USB commands state, ps, logall; LAUREL STATE and LAUREL SSH lines.
Both kernels (iOS 16 and iOS 26). docs/laurel_sprout/ios26-first-boot.md. Kill switch laurelstate=0.

