  *   log         the live log sends the last 64 KiB of the console again
+ *   logall      the live log sends all of the console ring again (laurel 2951)
+ *   state       what the user processes did since boot, several datagrams, last line "end" (laurel 2951)
+ *   ps          all processes, several datagrams, last line "end" (laurel 2951)
  *   reboot      IMEM reason normal, PSCI SYSTEM_RESET (laurel_reboot.c)
